## Section 3: Comparing and Ordering Numbers  

Additional:
Different comparison vocab
- {>} (greater than, more than, larger than, longer than, higher than, above, exceeds, over), {>=} (greater than or equal to, at least, more than or equal to, minimum, no less than, not under/below, not smaller than), {<} (less than, fewer than, smaller than, shorter than, lower than, under below, beneath), {<=} (at most, does not exceed, maximum, no more than, up to, not above/greater than)
> 좀 많긴한데 at least/minimum이랑 at most/maximum만 외우면 sat 수학은 해결
> 무작정 외우지 말고 문제 읽을때 한번 뜻을 생각해보면 이해가 됨

